{% block main %}
    <h1>Open Graph image</h1>
    <p>
        This example sets a custom Open Graph image with <code>pageConfig.ogImg</code>, using a non-default absolute URL, dimensions, and
        MIME type. The image is emitted as <code>og:image</code> meta tags in the document <code>head</code> — it is not shown as on-page
        UI. To verify, use View Source or DevTools Elements, or paste a public page URL into a platform sharing debugger (for example
        LinkedIn or Facebook). The <code>example.com</code> URL here is illustrative only; use a real absolute image URL in a live service.
    </p>
{% endblock %}
